review.reviewBody:
I didn't have a grill available so I started the burgers in an ovenproof pan for about two to three minutes a side and then finished in a 350 oven for ten minutes. I used Panko bread crumbs and to add a bit of texture I added 1/2 cup of toasted unsalted peppina (pumpkin) seeds.
I served them with a mango chutney sauce. Mix;
1/2 cup mayo. Teaspoon curry. 2 Tablespoons mango chutney. Pinch of chili powder.2 Tablespoons of lime juice.
